очка, статус, ховер, тонкая линия</p><dl class="sw__rows"><dt>HEX</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="#67FFD9" title="Скопировать">#67FFD9</button></dd><dt>RGB</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="R103 G255 B217" title="Скопировать">R103 G255 B217</button></dd><dt>CMYK</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="C51 M0 Y31 K0" title="Скопировать">C51 M0 Y31 K0</button></dd><dt>RAL</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="RAL Classic 6027" title="Скопировать">Classic 6027</button></dd><dt>RAL D</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="RAL Design 165 70 60" title="Скопировать">Design 165 70 60</button></dd></dl></div></div><div class="sw"><div class="sw__chip" style="background:#EFF2F2;color:#090A0C;"><b>Paper</b><span class="dd-label">#EFF2F2</span></div><div class="sw__body"><p class="sw__role">Фон длинных светлых носителей</p><dl class="sw__rows"><dt>HEX</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="#EFF2F2" title="Скопировать">#EFF2F2</button></dd><dt>RGB</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="R239 G242 B242" title="Скопировать">R239 G242 B242</button></dd><dt>CMYK</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="C8 M4 Y5 K0" title="Скопировать">C8 M4 Y5 K0</button></dd><dt>RAL</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="RAL Classic 9003" title="Скопировать">Classic 9003</button></dd><dt>RAL D</dt><dd><button type="button" class="cp" data-copy="RAL Design 180 94 01" title="Скопировать">Design 180 94 01</button></dd></dl></div></div>
